{
  "id": "1SA.23",
  "number": "23",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Sam 23",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "23",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitajeuo Daudi enkang e Keila",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninche Daudi, “Ng'ura, earita Ilfilisti Keila nepurrito nenen neeitobirieki enkurma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eikilikuanishore Daudi Olaitoriani, “Kalo nanu aar kulo Filisti?” Nejoki Olaitoriani Daudi, “Shomo taara pee intajeu Keila.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaakitia iltung'ana le Daudi ninye, “Ng'ura, eikiureisho iyiook tene te Yuda; kebaa naa naaji ti nikipuo Keila aarare injorin oo Lfilisti?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ake Daudi aikilikuanishore Olaitoriani. Newaliki Olaitoriani ninye ajo, “Tudumunye, tadoi shomo Keila; amu kaishoru nanu Ilfilisti apik atua nkaik inono.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo Daudi o ltung'ana lenyena Keila, nearare Ilfilisti, neyau nchoo enye, near iltung'ana kumok metuata tiatua ninche. Neaku etokordua Daudi lelo oomanya Keila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa pee eisik Abiata olayioni le Ahimelek alo enetii Daudi te Keila, nedou ninye alotu eeta enkila dorrop te nkaina enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netiaakaki apa Saul nchere eewuo Daudi Keila. Nejo Saul, “Eishorua Enkai ninye apik atua nkaik aainei amu eikenoyie ninye kewan ajing enkanasa naata nchomito oo sekenke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neipotu Saul iltung'ana pooki meetu olarrabal, metadoi aapuo Keila, pee eng'adu Daudi o ltung'ana lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyiolou Daudi ajo eitobirita Saul entorroni te nkaraki ninye; nejoki ninye Abiata ilo apolosani, “Iyau ina kila dorrop ene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Daudi, “Olaitoriani, Enkai e Israel, etoning'o osinka lino asipu nchere keing'oru Saul pee elotu Keila pee eidaikie enkang te nkaraki nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaa, kaaishooyo nanu iltung'ana le Keila aapik atua enkaina enye? Kedou Saul alotu, anaa enatoning'o osinka lino? Olaitoriani, Enkai e Israel, aatasayia iyie, toliki osinka lino.” Nejo Olaitoriani, “Kedou ninye alotu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Daudi ajo, “Amaa, kaishooyo nanu iltung'ana le Keila iltung'ana laainei aapik atua enkaina e Saul?” Nejo Olaitoriani, “Eikinchooyo ninche.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye Daudi o ltung'ana lenyena, oobaya iip ile neing'uaa Keila, nepuo ninche eneba anaa eneidim aashom. Ore ake pee elikini Saul nchere eisika Daudi nepal elototo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi te nkop oo ldoinyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neton Daudi ti atua ilnukat ti ong'ota, te ina kop oo ldoinyo lo lpurkel le Sif. Neing'oru Saul ninye nkolong'i pooki, kake eitu epik ninye Enkai atua enkaina enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiruto apa Daudi enkaraki naipang'u Saul alo aing'oru enkishui enye. Netii apa Daudi ong'ata e Sif te Horesh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye Yonatan, olayioni le Saul, nelo enetii Daudi te Horesh, neitagol enkaina enye te Nkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki, “Miureisho amu ore enkaina e Saul, papaai lai, mikitum iyie; iaku iyie olaiguanani te Israel, naaku nanu oliare te iyie; eyiolo sii Saul papaai lai ena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 18.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nenya pokira oare olmumai lo sotua te dukuya Olaitoriani; neton Daudi te Horesh, nelo Yonatan ang.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuo Ilsifi enetii Saul te Gibea, ejo, “Aimeisudori Daudi ti atua iyiook too lnukat te Horesh, ldoinyo le Hakila, le kopikop e Yesimon? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tadou naa wou, olaiguanani, te risioroto e yieunoto o ltau lino pooki pee idou alotu; ore erishata ang naa pee kinchoru ninye aapik atua enkaina o laiguanani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Saul, “Metamayiana intae Olaitoriani; amu inotito intae olng'ur te nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enchom, enyaaki entisipa oleng; entayiolo nidolidolo eneisudoriyie, naa kaing'ae otodua ninye te ine; amu aatiaakaki nchere eikalamas ninye oleng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entodol naa, nijurrurru iwuejitin oshi neeisudoriyie, o neerreshishore, nishukunyenye enatii iatata olomoni osipa, pee alo nanu te nebo intae; naa te netii ninye ina kop, naing'oru nanu ninye ti atua nkalifuni pooki e Yuda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye ninche, nepuo Sif aaituruk te Saul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii apa Daudi o ltung'ana lenyena ong'ata e Maon, ti atua Araba te nkalo e kopikop e Yesimon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo Saul o ltung'ana lenyena aaing'oru ninye. Nelikini Daudi; neaku etadoyie alo endapidapoi natii ong'ata e Moan. Ore ake pee ening Saul ina, nesujaa Daudi ti ong'ata e Moan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo Saul enchoto nabo o ldoinyo, nelo Daudi o ltung'ana lenyena te nkai shoto o ldoinyo, neisarisarita apa Daudi pee eilany Saul, ore etinyikutua Saul o ltung'ana lenyena aapunyaki Daudi o ltung'ana lenyena pee eibung ninche, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nelotu olkipaaret enetii Saul, ejo, “Isarisaru wou; amu etaara Ilfilisti enkop.” ",
